{"id": "unknown-2026-06-03-009", "date": "2026-06-03", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 6, "week": 23, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Anker Solix launches 2 kWh home backup power system", "content": "<p>The Chinese manufacturer says the new S2000, with a 400 W solar input, can deliver up to 35 hours of continuous refrigerator backup.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/03/anker-solix-launches-2-kwh-home-backup-power-system/\">Anker Solix launches 2 kWh home backup power system</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com\">pv magazine Global</a>.</p>\n", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/03/anker-solix-launches-2-kwh-home-backup-power-system/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-06-03-010", "date": "2026-06-03", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 6, "week": 23, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 1.0, "keywords": ["surpass"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.65, "reasons": ["情緒極端"]}, "title": "Mexico surpasses 5 GW of distributed solar capacity", "content": "<p>Figures published by Mexico’s National Energy Commission show solar accounted for more than 99.5% of distributed generation capacity in systems smaller than 0.7 MW at the end of 2025.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/03/mexico-supera-en-2025-los-5-gw-solares-en-generacion-distribuida/\">Mexico surpasses 5 GW of distributed solar capacity</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com\">pv magazine Global</a>.</p>\n", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/03/mexico-supera-en-2025-los-5-gw-solares-en-generacion-distribuida/", "type": "rss"}]}
